title: "taurus-gcfd-tracker: Generalized Cross-Frequency Decomposition for EEG/MEG Coherence"
abstract: "An open-source Python library for computing cross-frequency phase synchronization (PLV) from EEG/MEG signals, with clinical presets for 8 neurological conditions and an interactive web dashboard."
